{"version":1,"content":"<p>在電子產品行業相關犯罪中，人們通常聽到的是顯卡盜竊、伺服器設備失竊、硬件詐騙或網絡攻擊案件。然而，巴西近日曝光的一起案件卻因手法離奇而引發廣泛關注。一名商人被指控為打擊商業競爭對手，竟將爆炸裝置藏入一台Xbox 360遊戲機中，並將其送往對方店鋪。 </p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1586888.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T06:26:51.175520+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T06:16:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T06:20:10.289037+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T06:20:10.289037+00:00","content_hash":"012d053d088be454982ee50a654244b9d281927fdbc8214926747be64ea79212","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}